In making an assessment of a candidate's teaching, the University regards the following general areas as
being of central importance:

7.4.1 For lecturer grades - teaching methods which incorporate innovation and enterprise
development/industrialization;
7.4.1.1 Module content which incorporates innovation, and industrialization;
